# Stand-ins for the postBuild substitution variables Terraform publishes, so
# validate.sh can render what kustomize-controller renders. One line per key
# of every object a clusters/*/ Kustomization lists in substituteFrom. The
# values only have to be shaped right, not be real.

# cluster-versions (ConfigMap, flux-system)
talos_version=v1.12.0
kubernetes_version=v1.35.0
